# Hako-dama / box-ball score: yellow first, then a long-box right/top/left route to red.
# Goal: high-speed box pattern that brings the cue ball back behind the final ball.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (2.657, 2.191)
ball yellow at (2.463, 5.988)
ball red at (0.962, 6.314)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(36)
trace(max_events: 36)
shot(cue).heading(53.000600079deg).speed(143.438475339ips).tip(side: -0.281589820R, height: 0.022727642R).elevation(10.699082506deg).using(default)
